  m_text: "This project is about the feeling of a calm ride through an ordinary city.
    Sitting on a bus, looking out the window, letting your mind rest.\n\nThere\u2019s
    nothing special happening,  just everyday life and familiar cozy streets.\n\nIt\u2019s
    a moment to put on your headphones and quietly watch the city pass by."
